"transition-to-the-Enthought-Deployment-Manager-EDM-and-Visual-Studio-"
"Code>`_。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1451
msgid "`WinPython <https://winpython.github.io/>`_"
msgstr "`WinPython <https://winpython.github.io/>`_"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1452
msgid ""
"Windows-specific distribution with prebuilt scientific packages and tools "
"for building packages."
msgstr "Windows 專用的發行版，附有預先建置的科學套件和用於建置套件的工具。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1455
msgid ""
"Note that these packages may not include the latest versions of Python or "
"other libraries, and are not maintained or supported by the core Python team."
msgstr ""
"請注意，這些套件可能不包含最新版本的 Python 或其他函式庫，且並非由 Python 核"
"心團隊維護或支援。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1460
msgid "Supported Windows versions"
msgstr "支援的 Windows 版本"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1462
msgid ""
"As specified in :pep:`11`, a Python release only supports a Windows platform "
"while Microsoft considers the platform under extended support. This means "
"that Python |version| supports Windows 10 and newer. If you require Windows "
"7 support, install Python 3.8. If you require Windows 8.1 support, install "
"Python 3.12."
msgstr ""
"如 :pep:`11` 所述，只有在 Microsoft 仍將某個 Windows 平台視為處於延伸支援期間"
"時，Python 的發行版本才會支援該平台。這表示 Python |version| 支援 Windows 10 "
"及更新的版本。如果你需要 Windows 7 支援，請安裝 Python 3.8。如果你需要 "
"Windows 8.1 支援，請安裝 Python 3.12。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1472 ../../using/windows.rst:1759
msgid "Removing the MAX_PATH limitation"
msgstr "移除 MAX_PATH 限制"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1474 ../../using/windows.rst:1761
msgid ""
"Windows historically has limited path lengths to 260 characters. This meant "
"that paths longer than this would not resolve and errors would result."
msgstr ""
"Windows 過去一直將路徑長度限制在 260 個字元。這表示超過此長度的路徑將無法解"
"析，並會導致錯誤。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1477
msgid ""
"In the latest versions of Windows, this limitation can be expanded to over "
"32,000 characters. Your administrator will need to activate the \"Enable "
"Win32 long paths\" group policy, or set ``LongPathsEnabled`` to ``1`` in the "
"registry key "
"``HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\FileSystem``."
msgstr ""
"在最新版本的 Windows 中，此限制可以放寬到超過 32,000 個字元。你的系統管理員需"
"要啟用「啟用 Win32 長路徑」(Enable Win32 long paths) 群組原則，或在登錄機碼 "
"``HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\FileSystem`` 中將 "
"``LongPathsEnabled`` 設為 ``1``。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1482 ../../using/windows.rst:1770
msgid ""
"This allows the :func:`open` function, the :mod:`os` module and most other "
"path functionality to accept and return paths longer than 260 characters."
msgstr ""
"這讓 :func:`open` 函式、:mod:`os` 模組和大多數其他路徑功能都能接受並回傳超過 "
"260 個字元的路徑。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1485
msgid ""
"After changing the above option and rebooting, no further configuration is "
"required."
msgstr "變更上述選項並重新開機後，就不需要再進行其他設定。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1492
msgid "UTF-8 mode"
msgstr "UTF-8 模式"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1497
msgid "Python UTF-8 mode is now enabled by default (:pep:`686`)."
msgstr "Python UTF-8 模式現在預設為啟用（:pep:`686`）。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1499
msgid ""
"Windows still uses legacy encodings for the system encoding (the ANSI Code "
"Page).  When the :ref:`Python UTF-8 Mode <utf8-mode>` is disabled, Python "
"uses the ANSI Code Page as the default encoding of text files, as returned "
"by :func:`locale.getencoding`."
msgstr ""
"Windows 的系統編碼仍使用舊式編碼（ANSI 碼頁）。當 :ref:`Python UTF-8 模式 "
"<utf8-mode>`\\ 停用時，Python 會使用 ANSI 碼頁作為文字檔案的預設編碼，也就"
"是 :func:`locale.getencoding` 所回傳的編碼。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1504
msgid ""
"This may cause issues because UTF-8 is widely used on the internet and most "
"Unix systems, including WSL (Windows Subsystem for Linux)."
msgstr ""
"這可能會造成問題，因為 UTF-8 在網際網路和大多數 Unix 系統上被廣泛使用，包括 "
"WSL (Windows Subsystem for Linux)。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1507
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Python UTF-8 Mode <utf8-mode>`, enabled by default, ignores the "
"system encoding and uses UTF-8 as the default text encoding. When "
"the :ref:`UTF-8 mode <utf8-mode>` is enabled, you can still use the system "
"encoding (the ANSI Code Page) via the \"mbcs\" codec."
msgstr ""
"預設啟用的 :ref:`Python UTF-8 模式 <utf8-mode>`\\ 會忽略系統編碼，並使用 "
"UTF-8 作為預設的文字編碼。當 :ref:`UTF-8 模式 <utf8-mode>`\\ 啟用時，你仍然可"
"以透過「mbcs」編解碼器來使用系統編碼（ANSI 碼頁）。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1512
msgid ""
"You can disable the :ref:`Python UTF-8 Mode <utf8-mode>` via the ``-X "
"utf8=0`` command line option, or the ``PYTHONUTF8=0`` environment variable.  "
"See :envvar:`PYTHONUTF8` for disabling UTF-8 mode, and :ref:`setting-"
"envvars` for how to modify environment variables."
msgstr ""
"你可以透過 ``-X utf8=0`` 命令列選項或 ``PYTHONUTF8=0`` 環境變數來停"
"用 :ref:`Python UTF-8 模式 <utf8-mode>`。關於停用 UTF-8 模式，請參"
"閱 :envvar:`PYTHONUTF8`；關於如何修改環境變數，請參閱 :ref:`setting-"
"envvars`。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1518
msgid ""
"Adding ``PYTHONUTF8={0,1}`` to the default environment variables will affect "
"all Python 3.7+ applications on your system. If you have any Python 3.7+ "
"applications which rely on the legacy system encoding, it is recommended to "
"set the environment variable temporarily or use the ``-X utf8`` command line "
"option."
msgstr ""
"將 ``PYTHONUTF8={0,1}`` 加入預設環境變數，會影響你系統上所有 Python 3.7 以上"
"版本的應用程式。如果你有任何依賴舊式系統編碼的 Python 3.7 以上版本應用程式，"
"建議暫時設定該環境變數，或使用 ``-X utf8`` 命令列選項。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1525
msgid ""
"Even when UTF-8 mode is disabled, Python uses UTF-8 by default on Windows "
"for:"
msgstr ""
"即使停用了 UTF-8 模式，Python 在 Windows 上預設仍會對以下項目使用 UTF-8："

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1528
msgid "Console I/O including standard I/O (see :pep:`528` for details)."
msgstr "主控台 I/O，包括標準 I/O（詳見 :pep:`528`）。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1529
msgid ""
"The :term:`filesystem encoding <filesystem encoding and error handler>` "
"(see :pep:`529` for details)."
msgstr ""
":term:`檔案系統編碼 <filesystem encoding and error handler>`\\ （詳"
"見 :pep:`529`）。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1536
msgid "Finding modules"
msgstr "找尋模組"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1538
msgid ""
"These notes supplement the description at :ref:`sys-path-init` with detailed "
"Windows notes."
msgstr ""
"這些說明補充了 :ref:`sys-path-init`\\ 中的描述，提供詳細的 Windows 相關說明。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1541
msgid ""
"When no ``._pth`` file is found, this is how :data:`sys.path` is populated "
"on Windows:"
msgstr ""
"當找不到 ``._pth`` 檔案時，以下是 :data:`sys.path` 在 Windows 上的填入方式："

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1544
msgid ""
"An empty entry is added at the start, which corresponds to the current "
"directory."
msgstr "會在開頭加入一個空項目，它對應於目前目錄。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1547
msgid ""
"If the environment variable :envvar:`PYTHONPATH` exists, as described "
"in :ref:`using-on-envvars`, its entries are added next.  Note that on "
"Windows, paths in this variable must be separated by semicolons, to "
"distinguish them from the colon used in drive identifiers (such as ``C:\\``)."
msgstr ""
"如果環境變數 :envvar:`PYTHONPATH` 存在（如\\ :ref:`using-on-envvars`\\ 中所"
"述），接著會加入它的項目。請注意，在 Windows 上，此變數中的路徑必須以分號分"
"隔，以便與磁碟機代號中使用的冒號（例如 ``C:\\``）區分。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1552
msgid ""
"Additional \"application paths\" can be added in the registry as subkeys "
"of :samp:`\\\\SOFTWARE\\\\Python\\\\PythonCore\\\\{version}\\\\PythonPath` "
"under both the ``HKEY_CURRENT_USER`` and ``HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE`` hives.  "
"Subkeys which have semicolon-delimited path strings as their default value "
"will cause each path to be added to :data:`sys.path`.  (Note that all known "
"installers only use HKLM, so HKCU is typically empty.)"
msgstr ""
"可以在登錄檔中，於 ``HKEY_CURRENT_USER`` 和 ``HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE`` 兩個登錄"
"區 (hive) 下，以 :samp:`\\\\SOFTWARE\\\\Python\\\\PythonCore\\\\{version}\\"
"\\PythonPath` 的子機碼形式加入額外的「應用程式路徑」。以分號分隔之路徑字串作"
"為預設值的子機碼，會使其中每個路徑都被加入 :data:`sys.path`。（請注意，所有已"
"知的安裝程式都只使用 HKLM，因此 HKCU 通常是空的。）"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1559
msgid ""
"If the environment variable :envvar:`PYTHONHOME` is set, it is assumed as "
"\"Python Home\".  Otherwise, the path of the main Python executable is used "
"to locate a \"landmark file\" (either ``Lib\\os.py`` or ``pythonXY.zip``) to "
"deduce the \"Python Home\".  If a Python home is found, the relevant sub-"
"directories added to :data:`sys.path` (such as ``Lib`` and ``plat-win``) are "
"based on that folder.  Otherwise, the core Python path is constructed from "
"the PythonPath stored in the registry."
msgstr ""
"如果設定了環境變數 :envvar:`PYTHONHOME`，就會將其假定為「Python Home」。否"
"則，會使用主要 Python 可執行檔的路徑來找出「地標檔案」(landmark file)"
"（``Lib\\os.py`` 或 ``pythonXY.zip``），以推導出「Python Home」。如果找到了 "
"Python home，加入 :data:`sys.path` 的相關子目錄（例如 ``Lib`` 和 ``plat-"
"win``）就會以該資料夾為基礎。否則，核心 Python 路徑會由儲存在登錄檔中的 "
"PythonPath 建構而成。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1567
msgid ""
"If the Python Home cannot be located, no :envvar:`PYTHONPATH` is specified "
"in the environment, and no registry entries can be found, a default path "
"with relative entries is used (for example, ``.\\Lib;.\\plat-win``)."
msgstr ""
"如果找不到 Python Home、環境中沒有指定 :envvar:`PYTHONPATH`，而且也找不到任何"
"登錄檔項目，則會使用一個包含相對項目的預設路徑（例如 ``.\\Lib;.\\plat-"
"win``）。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1571
msgid ""
"If a ``pyvenv.cfg`` file is found alongside the main executable or in the "
"directory one level above the executable, the following variations apply:"
msgstr ""
"如果在主要可執行檔旁邊，或在可執行檔上一層的目錄中找到 ``pyvenv.cfg`` 檔案，"
"則適用以下變化："

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1574
msgid ""
"If ``home`` is an absolute path and :envvar:`PYTHONHOME` is not set, this "
"path is used instead of the path to the main executable when deducing the "
"home location."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``home`` 是絕對路徑且未設定 :envvar:`PYTHONHOME`，則在推導 home 位置時，"
"會使用此路徑而不是主要可執行檔的路徑。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1578
msgid "The end result of all this is:"
msgstr "最終這所有的結果為："

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1580
msgid ""
"When running :file:`python.exe`, or any other .exe in the main Python "
"directory (either an installed version, or directly from the PCbuild "
"directory), the core path is deduced, and the core paths in the registry are "
"ignored.  Other \"application paths\" in the registry are always read."
msgstr ""
"當執行 :file:`python.exe` 或主要 Python 目錄中的任何其他 .exe 時（無論是已安"
"裝的版本，或直接從 PCbuild 目錄執行），會推導出核心路徑，並忽略登錄檔中的核心"
"路徑。登錄檔中的其他「應用程式路徑」則一律會被讀取。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1585
msgid ""
"When Python is hosted in another .exe (for example, in a different directory "
"or embedded via COM), the \"Python Home\" will not be deduced, so the core "
"path from the registry is used.  Other \"application paths\" in the registry "
"are always read."
msgstr ""
"當 Python 由另一個 .exe 載入執行時（例如位於不同的目錄，或透過 COM 嵌入），就"
"不會推導出「Python Home」，因此會使用登錄檔中的核心路徑。登錄檔中的其他「應用"
"程式路徑」則一律會被讀取。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1589
msgid ""
"If Python can't find its home and there are no registry values (frozen .exe, "
"some very strange installation setup) you get a path with some default, but "
"relative, paths."
msgstr ""
"如果 Python 找不到它的 home，而且也沒有任何登錄值（凍結的 .exe、某些非常奇怪"
"的安裝設定），你會得到由若干預設的相對路徑所組成的路徑。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1593
msgid ""
"For those who want to bundle Python into their application or distribution, "
"the following advice will prevent conflicts with other installations:"
msgstr ""
"對於想將 Python 打包進自己的應用程式或發行版中的人，以下建議可以避免與其他安"
"裝發生衝突："

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1596
msgid ""
"Include a ``._pth`` file alongside your executable containing the "
"directories to include. This will ignore paths listed in the registry and "
"environment variables, and also ignore :mod:`site` unless ``import site`` is "
"listed."
msgstr ""
"在你的可執行檔旁邊放置一個 ``._pth`` 檔案，其中包含要納入的目錄。這會忽略登錄"
"檔和環境變數中列出的路徑，而且除非列出了 ``import site``，否則也會忽"
"略 :mod:`site`。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1601
msgid ""
"If you are loading :file:`python3.dll` or |python_xy_dll_literal| in your "
"own executable, explicitly set :c:member:`PyConfig.module_search_paths` "
"before :c:func:`Py_InitializeFromConfig`."
msgstr ""
"如果你在自己的可執行檔中載入 :file:`python3.dll` 或 |python_xy_dll_literal|，"
"請在 :c:func:`Py_InitializeFromConfig` 之前明確設"
"定 :c:member:`PyConfig.module_search_paths`。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1605
msgid ""
"Clear and/or overwrite :envvar:`PYTHONPATH` and set :envvar:`PYTHONHOME` "
"before launching :file:`python.exe` from your application."
msgstr ""
"在從你的應用程式啟動 :file:`python.exe` 之前，清除和（或）覆"
"寫 :envvar:`PYTHONPATH`，並設定 :envvar:`PYTHONHOME`。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1608
msgid ""
"If you cannot use the previous suggestions (for example, you are a "
"distribution that allows people to run :file:`python.exe` directly), ensure "
"that the landmark file (:file:`Lib\\\\os.py`) exists in your install "
"directory. (Note that it will not be detected inside a ZIP file, but a "
"correctly named ZIP file will be detected instead.)"
msgstr ""
"如果你無法使用上述建議（例如，你是一個允許使用者直接執行 :file:`python.exe` "
"的發行版），請確保你的安裝目錄中有地標檔案 (landmark file) :file:`Lib\\"
"\\os.py`。（請注意，在 ZIP 檔案內不會偵測到它，但會改為偵測名稱正確的 ZIP 檔"
"案。）"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1614
msgid ""
"These will ensure that the files in a system-wide installation will not take "
"precedence over the copy of the standard library bundled with your "
"application. Otherwise, your users may experience problems using your "
"application. Note that the first suggestion is the best, as the others may "
"still be susceptible to non-standard paths in the registry and user site-"
"packages."
msgstr ""
"這些做法能確保全系統安裝中的檔案，不會優先於你的應用程式所附帶的標準函式庫副"
"本。否則，你的使用者在使用你的應用程式時可能會遇到問題。請注意，第一個建議是"
"最好的，因為其他做法仍可能受到登錄檔與使用者 site-packages 中非標準路徑的影"
"響。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1622
msgid ""
"Add ``._pth`` file support and remove ``applocal`` option from "
"``pyvenv.cfg``."
msgstr ""
"新增 ``._pth`` 檔案支援，並從 ``pyvenv.cfg`` 中移除 ``applocal`` 選項。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1627
msgid ""
"Add :file:`python{XX}.zip` as a potential landmark when directly adjacent to "
"the executable."
msgstr "新增將直接位於可執行檔旁的 :file:`python{XX}.zip` 作為可能的地標檔案。"

#: ../../using/windows.rst:1632
msgid ""
"Modules specified in the registry under ``Modules`` (not ``PythonPath``) may "
"be imported by :class:`importlib.machinery.WindowsRegistryFinder`. This "
"finder is enabled on Windows in 3.6.0 and earlier, but may need to be "
"explicitly added to :data:`sys.meta_path` in the future."
msgstr ""
"在登錄檔中 ``Modules``\\ （而非 ``PythonPath``）底下指定的模組，可以"
